# Claude Code scratch. Only the worktrees, which are checkouts of this repository and
# would otherwise be committed as embedded git repos -- `git add -A` picks one up as a
# bare gitlink, which clones cannot resolve. Everything else under .claude/ (settings,
# agents, skills, commands) is ordinary project config and stays trackable.
.claude/worktrees/
